+  // populated for discrete GPUs.  On gfx950, KFD topology reports
+  // local_mem_size = 0 on every GPU node while the same nodes report a
+  // FRAME_BUFFER_PUBLIC bank of 309,220,868,096 bytes.  A build carrying the
